ual outputs. Evidence is /tmp/artroom-checker-mcp-core-1d9ac5ad-compilation.json. The delta from the fully reviewed b22 head is limited to the repaired protocol/comments/example; index.ts is unchanged. One implementing commit on sole parent 9615f449853c505b53cde1d93792330415618f67 changes exactly the four published paths, carries the full canonical a9788a59 Rests-On trailer and passes diff --check. All four artifacts, supersessions, original request, current invitation and review promise were individually inspected. A parallel read-only authority review independently found the original findings resolved; root verified the relevant rules. No executable guard is added here and no runtime mutation result is claimed.\n\nReview preparation confirms these Git artifacts bind to assigned implementation a9788a59. A guarded approved verdict on them would be mergeable, unlike the requested contract-only handoff. This ordinary report on the review promise therefore records the completed inspection without that grant. Planner retains the original implementation binding and must republish its final composed passing head for the actual approval.","body":{"no_git_result":"true"}}